   "text": "Functional requirements",
   "originalText": "Functional requirements",
   "fontSize": 30,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el4_160816",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26.0,
   "y": 214,
   "width": 692.64,
   "height": 292.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1953574603,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1089709947,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1.  Search restaurants by location\n2.  View a restaurant's menu (item code, name, price)\n3.  Add items to the cart (one restaurant per cart at a time)\n4.  Remove items, clear the cart, see the cart total\n5.  Place an order as Delivery (to user address) or Pickup (at restaurant)\n6.  Order now, or schedule the order for a later time\n7.  Pay using UPI, Credit Card or NetBanking\n8.  Notify the user once the order is placed\n9.  Admin: add / update / remove restaurants and menu items\n10. Look up an order by its id\n\nOut of scope (say this out loud in an interview):\ndelivery agent assignment, live tracking, ratings, coupons, login/auth",
   "originalText": "1.  Search restaurants by location\n2.  View a restaurant's menu (item code, name, price)\n3.  Add items to the cart (one restaurant per cart at a time)\n4.  Remove items, clear the cart, see the cart total\n5.  Place an order as Delivery (to user address) or Pickup (at restaurant)\n6.  Order now, or schedule the order for a later time\n7.  Pay using UPI, Credit Card or NetBanking\n8.  Notify the user once the order is placed\n9.  Admin: add / update / remove restaurants and menu items\n10. Look up an order by its id\n\nOut of scope (say this out loud in an interview):\ndelivery agent assignment, live tracking, ratings, coupons, login/auth",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
