   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "«model»\n   Plain data entity, a noun from the requirements.\n   Holds state + getters, very little logic.\n   User, Restaurant, MenuItem, Cart, Order\n\n«abstract»\n   Cannot be instantiated. Has at least one pure virtual method,\n   but may also hold fields and shared code.\n   Order  (virtual string getType() const = 0;)\n   Always give it a virtual destructor.\n\n«interface»\n   Pure contract: only pure virtual methods, no data.\n   OrderFactory, PaymentStrategy\n   Implemented with a dashed line + hollow triangle.\n\n«singleton»\n   Exactly one instance. Private constructor, deleted copy,\n   static getInstance().   RestaurantManager, OrderManager\n\nOthers you will see:\n   «enum»  OrderStatus, PaymentMode\n   «service»  NotificationService (stateless behaviour)\n   «facade» / orchestrator  TomatoApp\n   «utility»  static helpers (TimeUtils, IdGenerator)\n\nAbstract vs interface:  abstract = \"is a kind of, shares code\"\n                                   interface = \"can do this\"\n",
   "originalText": "«model»\n   Plain data entity, a noun from the requirements.\n   Holds state + getters, very little logic.\n   User, Restaurant, MenuItem, Cart, Order\n\n«abstract»\n   Cannot be instantiated. Has at least one pure virtual method,\n   but may also hold fields and shared code.\n   Order  (virtual string getType() const = 0;)\n   Always give it a virtual destructor.\n\n«interface»\n   Pure contract: only pure virtual methods, no data.\n   OrderFactory, PaymentStrategy\n   Implemented with a dashed line + hollow triangle.\n\n«singleton»\n   Exactly one instance. Private constructor, deleted copy,\n   static getInstance().   RestaurantManager, OrderManager\n\nOthers you will see:\n   «enum»  OrderStatus, PaymentMode\n   «service»  NotificationService (stateless behaviour)\n   «facade» / orchestrator  TomatoApp\n   «utility»  static helpers (TimeUtils, IdGenerator)\n\nAbstract vs interface:  abstract = \"is a kind of, shares code\"\n                                   interface = \"can do this\"\n",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
