  {
   "id": "el124_606098",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26,
   "y": 2425.5,
   "width": 486.72,
   "height": 450.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1340172369,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2115806099,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1          exactly one\n0..1      zero or one (optional)\n*          many (same as 0..*)\n0..*      zero or more\n1..*      one or more\n\nWrite it with TWO dots: 1..*  (not 1...*)\nPut it at the end being counted:\nRestaurant 1 ◆──── 1..* MenuItem\nreads \"one Restaurant has one or more MenuItems\"\n\nStrength (weak → strong coupling):\nDependency < Association < Aggregation < Composition\n\nQuick tests:\n• Is it a kind of? → inheritance (is-a)\n• Whole deleted, part dies too? → composition\n• Part survives on its own? → aggregation\n• Only a method param / local var? → dependency\n• Otherwise a stored pointer? → association",
   "originalText": "1          exactly one\n0..1      zero or one (optional)\n*          many (same as 0..*)\n0..*      zero or more\n1..*      one or more\n\nWrite it with TWO dots: 1..*  (not 1...*)\nPut it at the end being counted:\nRestaurant 1 ◆──── 1..* MenuItem\nreads \"one Restaurant has one or more MenuItems\"\n\nStrength (weak → strong coupling):\nDependency < Association < Aggregation < Composition\n\nQuick tests:\n• Is it a kind of? → inheritance (is-a)\n• Whole deleted, part dies too? → composition\n• Part survives on its own? → aggregation\n• Only a method param / local var? → dependency\n• Otherwise a stored pointer? → association",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
