  {
   "id": "el127_460717",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 776,
   "y": 2425.5,
   "width": 681.6,
   "height": 360.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1717221869,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1381117824,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "User              ◆──  Cart                    composition   1 : 1\nCart              ──>  Restaurant              association   * : 1\nCart              ──>  MenuItem                association   1 : 0..*\nRestaurant        ◆──  MenuItem                composition   1 : 1..*\nRestaurantManager ◇──  Restaurant              aggregation   1 : 0..*\nOrderManager      ◇──  Order                   aggregation   1 : 0..*\nOrder             ──>  User, Restaurant        association   * : 1\nOrder             ◆──  MenuItem (snapshot)     composition   1 : 1..*\nOrder             ──>  PaymentStrategy         association   1 : 1\nDeliveryOrder     ──▷  Order                   inheritance   is-a\nPickupOrder       ──▷  Order                   inheritance   is-a\nUpiPayment etc.   ┈┈▷  PaymentStrategy         realization   implements\nNowOrderFactory   ┈┈▷  OrderFactory            realization   implements\nScheduledFactory  ┈┈▷  OrderFactory            realization   implements\nOrderFactory      ┈┈>  DeliveryOrder, Pickup   dependency    creates\nTomatoApp         ──>  both Managers           association   uses\nNotificationSvc   ┈┈>  Order                   dependency    param\nClient (main)     ┈┈>  TomatoApp               dependency    calls",
   "originalText": "User              ◆──  Cart                    composition   1 : 1\nCart              ──>  Restaurant              association   * : 1\nCart              ──>  MenuItem                association   1 : 0..*\nRestaurant        ◆──  MenuItem                composition   1 : 1..*\nRestaurantManager ◇──  Restaurant              aggregation   1 : 0..*\nOrderManager      ◇──  Order                   aggregation   1 : 0..*\nOrder             ──>  User, Restaurant        association   * : 1\nOrder             ◆──  MenuItem (snapshot)     composition   1 : 1..*\nOrder             ──>  PaymentStrategy         association   1 : 1\nDeliveryOrder     ──▷  Order                   inheritance   is-a\nPickupOrder       ──▷  Order                   inheritance   is-a\nUpiPayment etc.   ┈┈▷  PaymentStrategy         realization   implements\nNowOrderFactory   ┈┈▷  OrderFactory            realization   implements\nScheduledFactory  ┈┈▷  OrderFactory            realization   implements\nOrderFactory      ┈┈>  DeliveryOrder, Pickup   dependency    creates\nTomatoApp         ──>  both Managers           association   uses\nNotificationSvc   ┈┈>  Order                   dependency    param\nClient (main)     ┈┈>  TomatoApp               dependency    calls",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
