  {
   "id": "el130_920304",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1966,
   "y": 2425.5,
   "width": 449.28000000000003,
   "height": 495.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1527919545,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1610914378,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "• Multiplicity: write 1..* (two dots), not 1...*\n\n• OrderFactory is «interface», so its children\n  use a DASHED line + hollow triangle\n  (realization), not a solid \"Extends\"\n\n• Order: Restaurant res and User user should\n  be pointers (association), not values\n\n• Order holds PaymentStrategy* : an abstract\n  type cannot be stored by value\n\n• getType(): void  →  + getType(): string\n  marked {abstract} (pure virtual)\n\n• Cart.total / Order.total should be double\n  (MenuItem.price is double)\n\n• Factories creating orders is a dependency\n  (dashed arrow), not a simple association\n\n• Add + / - to every member in each box",
   "originalText": "• Multiplicity: write 1..* (two dots), not 1...*\n\n• OrderFactory is «interface», so its children\n  use a DASHED line + hollow triangle\n  (realization), not a solid \"Extends\"\n\n• Order: Restaurant res and User user should\n  be pointers (association), not values\n\n• Order holds PaymentStrategy* : an abstract\n  type cannot be stored by value\n\n• getType(): void  →  + getType(): string\n  marked {abstract} (pure virtual)\n\n• Cart.total / Order.total should be double\n  (MenuItem.price is double)\n\n• Factories creating orders is a dependency\n  (dashed arrow), not a simple association\n\n• Add + / - to every member in each box",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
