   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el133_766728",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 26.0,
   "y": 3060.5,
   "width": 505.44,
   "height": 360.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 714075261,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 186293890,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Clarify requirements: ask questions, then write\n    functional + non-functional lists\n2. Underline nouns → candidate classes\n    (User, Restaurant, MenuItem, Cart, Order, Payment)\n3. Underline verbs → methods\n    (search, addToCart, placeOrder, pay, notify)\n4. Relationships: is-a or has-a? weak or strong?\n    what multiplicity?\n5. Find what varies (payment mode, order type, timing)\n    → that is where patterns go\n6. Managers for collections, a facade for the client\n7. Draw UML: «stereotype», +/- members, arrows,\n    multiplicities, has-a / is-a labels\n8. Code bottom-up: models → strategies → orders →\n    factories → managers → TomatoApp → main\n9. Walk one full flow end to end to validate",
   "originalText": "1. Clarify requirements: ask questions, then write\n    functional + non-functional lists\n2. Underline nouns → candidate classes\n    (User, Restaurant, MenuItem, Cart, Order, Payment)\n3. Underline verbs → methods\n    (search, addToCart, placeOrder, pay, notify)\n4. Relationships: is-a or has-a? weak or strong?\n    what multiplicity?\n5. Find what varies (payment mode, order type, timing)\n    → that is where patterns go\n6. Managers for collections, a facade for the client\n7. Draw UML: «stereotype», +/- members, arrows,\n    multiplicities, has-a / is-a labels\n8. Code bottom-up: models → strategies → orders →\n    factories → managers → TomatoApp → main\n9. Walk one full flow end to end to validate",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
