   "seed": 1874335756,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 945161047,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1795424234948,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1.  main → TomatoApp.searchRestaurants(\"Koramangala\") → RestaurantManager returns matching restaurants\n2.  TomatoApp.selectRestaurant(user, r) → user's cart is tied to that restaurant\n3.  TomatoApp.addToCart(user, \"P1\") → cart looks up the MenuItem by code and adds it, total updates\n4.  TomatoApp.checkoutNow(user, \"Delivery\", new UpiPayment(\"pranav@upi\")) → NowOrderFactory.createOrder(...) returns a DeliveryOrder*\n5.  OrderManager.getInstance().addOrder(order) → order stored by id\n6.  TomatoApp.payForOrder(user, order) → order.processPayment() → PaymentStrategy.pay(total)\n7.  If payment succeeds → NotificationService.notify(order), then cart.clear()",
   "originalText": "1.  main → TomatoApp.searchRestaurants(\"Koramangala\") → RestaurantManager returns matching restaurants\n2.  TomatoApp.selectRestaurant(user, r) → user's cart is tied to that restaurant\n3.  TomatoApp.addToCart(user, \"P1\") → cart looks up the MenuItem by code and adds it, total updates\n4.  TomatoApp.checkoutNow(user, \"Delivery\", new UpiPayment(\"pranav@upi\")) → NowOrderFactory.createOrder(...) returns a DeliveryOrder*\n5.  OrderManager.getInstance().addOrder(order) → order stored by id\n6.  TomatoApp.payForOrder(user, order) → order.processPayment() → PaymentStrategy.pay(total)\n7.  If payment succeeds → NotificationService.notify(order), then cart.clear()",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
